{"seq":3,"slug":"sampling-buffers","title":"采样与缓冲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/foundations/sampling-buffers","wordCount":1432,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"采样与缓冲\">采样与缓冲</h1><p>声音在物理世界是空气压强随时间的连续起伏，是一条没有断点的曲线。但数字系统里没有「连续」这回事——计算机只能存离散的数。把连续的声波变成一串数字，靠的是两步：每隔固定时间量一次压强值（<strong>采样</strong>），再把每次量到的值四舍五入到有限精度（<strong>量化</strong>）。Web Audio 图里每条连线上流动的，正是这样一串数字。看不懂这串数字，你就只能照抄 API；看懂了，性能、延迟、混响这些后面的难题都会找到物理解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三个数定义了数字音频的一切：采样率、位深、声道数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>采样率</strong>：每秒采多少个点，单位 Hz。Web Audio 内部统一用 32 位浮点，常见上下文采样率是 44100 或 48000 Hz。奈奎斯特定理说，采样率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时能无失真表示的最高频率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>；人耳上限约 20000 Hz，所以 44100 Hz 刚好够覆盖。</li>\n<li><strong>位深 / 量化精度</strong>：每个采样值用多少精度存。Web Audio 在图内部一律用 32 位浮点（Float32），取值范围规约到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，0 表示静音，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是满幅。文件可能是 16 位整数，但解码进图后都变成 Float32。</li>\n<li><strong>声道数</strong>：单声道 1 条、立体声 2 条、5.1 环绕 6 条。每条声道是一串独立的采样序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  W[&quot;连续声波&lt;br/&gt;(空气压强 vs 时间)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;采样: 每 1/fs 秒取一点&quot;| S[&quot;离散采样点序列&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt;|&quot;量化: 规约到 Float32 [-1,1]&quot;| Q[&quot;数字音频&quot;]&#10;  Q --&gt; BUF[&quot;AudioBuffer&lt;br/&gt;每声道一个 Float32Array&quot;]&#10;  BUF --&gt; GRAPH[&quot;在音频图里以 128 帧/块流动&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  W[\"连续声波&lt;br/&gt;(空气压强 vs 时间)\"] --&gt;|\"采样: 每 1/fs 秒取一点\"| S[\"离散采样点序列\"]\n  S --&gt;|\"量化: 规约到 Float32 [-1,1]\"| Q[\"数字音频\"]\n  Q --&gt; BUF[\"AudioBuffer&lt;br/&gt;每声道一个 Float32Array\"]\n  BUF --&gt; GRAPH[\"在音频图里以 128 帧/块流动\"]</pre><p>下表把三个维度和它们的工程含义对齐：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>决定了什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>44100 / 48000 Hz</td>\n<td>可表示的最高频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>、每秒数据量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位深（图内）</td>\n<td>32 位浮点</td>\n<td>动态范围、运算时的精度余量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取值范围</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>超出即削波失真（clipping）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声道数</td>\n<td>1 / 2 / 6</td>\n<td>内存占用、空间化能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"audiobuffer-声音在内存里的样子\">AudioBuffer：声音在内存里的样子</h2><p>一段加载进内存、可随机访问的声音，存在 <code>AudioBuffer</code> 里。它不是一个二进制 blob，而是「每个声道一个 Float32Array」的结构化对象。这就是为什么你能直接读写采样值——做反向播放、手动音量、或喂给可视化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 解码一个文件成 AudioBuffer&#10;const resp = await fetch(&#39;drum.wav&#39;);&#10;const arrayBuffer = await resp.arrayBuffer();&#10;const audioBuffer = await ctx.decodeAudioData(arrayBuffer);&#10;&#10;console.log(audioBuffer.sampleRate); // 44100&#10;console.log(audioBuffer.numberOfChannels); // 2&#10;console.log(audioBuffer.length); // 总帧数&#10;console.log(audioBuffer.duration); // length / sampleRate 秒&#10;&#10;// 直接拿到左声道的原始采样，做反向播放&#10;const left = audioBuffer.getChannelData(0); // Float32Array&#10;left.reverse();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 解码一个文件成 AudioBuffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const resp = await fetch('drum.wav');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const arrayBuffer = await resp.arrayBuffer();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const audioBuffer = await ctx.decodeAudioData(arrayBuffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(audioBuffer.sampleRate); // 44100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(audioBuffer.numberOfChannels); // 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(audioBuffer.length); // 总帧数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(audioBuffer.duration); // length / sampleRate 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 直接拿到左声道的原始采样，做反向播放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const left = audioBuffer.getChannelData(0); // Float32Array</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>left.reverse();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有个常被混淆的术语：<strong>帧（frame）vs 采样（sample）</strong>。一「帧」是所有声道在同一时刻的采样的集合——立体声里一帧含 2 个采样（左、右各一）。<code>audioBuffer.length</code> 数的是帧，时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>length</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\text{length} / f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">length</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。理解这点，后面所有按帧计的缓冲尺寸才不会算错。</p>\n<p>要把 AudioBuffer 播出去，得套一个 <code>AudioBufferSourceNode</code>（它是一次性的，播完即废，详见 <a href=\"../nodes/source-nodes\">源节点</a>）。AudioBuffer 本身只是数据，节点才是图上的盒子。还有一个特殊用途：卷积混响需要一段「脉冲响应」AudioBuffer，本质上就是某个空间的声学指纹，下面会引到 <a href=\"../synthesis/effects-convolution\">效果与卷积混响</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渲染量子-128-帧的心跳\">渲染量子：128 帧的心跳</h2><p>音频线程不是一个采样一个采样地处理——那样函数调用开销会压垮它。它以<strong>块</strong>为单位推进，每块固定 128 帧，规范里叫「渲染量子」（render quantum）。每过一个量子，图上每个节点都被要求算出这 128 帧的输出，整张图同步前进一步。</p>\n<p>这个数字解释了很多事。其一，<strong>延迟有下限</strong>：在 48000 Hz 下，一个量子是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>128</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>48000</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.67</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">128 / 48000 \\approx 2.67</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128/48000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.67</span></span></span></span></span> 毫秒，这是图内部处理粒度的物理底线，再加上硬件缓冲，端到端延迟通常在十几到几十毫秒。其二，<strong>自定义处理必须按块写</strong>：AudioWorklet 的 <code>process()</code> 每个量子被调一次，每次给你 128 帧，你不能假设能拿到任意长度（见 <a href=\"../synthesis/audio-worklet\">Audio Worklet 自定义处理</a>）。其三，<strong>性能预算极紧</strong>：每 2.67 毫秒整张图必须算完，否则就来不及交付下一块，用户听到爆音（见 <a href=\"../practice/audio-performance\">音频性能与延迟</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  T0[&quot;量子 0&lt;br/&gt;帧 0-127&quot;] --&gt; T1[&quot;量子 1&lt;br/&gt;帧 128-255&quot;]&#10;  T1 --&gt; T2[&quot;量子 2&lt;br/&gt;帧 256-383&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt; TN[&quot;...每 ~2.67ms 一拍...&quot;]&#10;  T0 --&gt; P[&quot;每拍: 全图每个节点&lt;br/&gt;算出本块 128 帧&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; DL[&quot;处理时间必须 &lt; 一个量子&lt;br/&gt;否则 → 爆音(glitch)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  T0[\"量子 0&lt;br/&gt;帧 0-127\"] --&gt; T1[\"量子 1&lt;br/&gt;帧 128-255\"]\n  T1 --&gt; T2[\"量子 2&lt;br/&gt;帧 256-383\"]\n  T2 --&gt; TN[\"...每 ~2.67ms 一拍...\"]\n  T0 --&gt; P[\"每拍: 全图每个节点&lt;br/&gt;算出本块 128 帧\"]\n  P --&gt; DL[\"处理时间必须 &lt; 一个量子&lt;br/&gt;否则 → 爆音(glitch)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"时间-频率与采样的换算\">时间、频率与采样的换算</h2><p>数字音频里时间和样本数可以自由换算，这是写精确调度和分析代码的基本功。在采样率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 秒对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\cdot f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 帧；第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 帧的时刻是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n / f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 秒。</li>\n<li>一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 点的 FFT 把时域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 帧变到频域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 个频率桶，每个桶的频率分辨率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s / N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（这条在 <a href=\"../nodes/analyser-visualization\">分析与可视化</a> 里直接用到）。</li>\n<li>一个 440 Hz 的纯音，在 44100 Hz 采样率下，一个周期占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>440</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>100.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44100 / 440 \\approx 100.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44100/440</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100.2</span></span></span></span></span> 帧——这解释了为什么合成的正弦波周期通常不是整数帧，相位会缓慢漂移。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些换算在合成、分析、调度三处反复出现。比如你想在「正好 1.5 秒后」触发一个音，用的是 <code>ctx.currentTime + 1.5</code>（秒）；但你想知道一个 FFT 桶代表多少赫兹，用的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s / N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。把秒、帧、赫兹三套单位在脑中对齐，是不出 bug 的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数字音频 = 采样（每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 秒取一点）+ 量化（规约到精度）；图内统一用 Float32、取值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，超出即削波。</li>\n<li>采样率决定可表示的最高频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>（奈奎斯特）；常见 44100/48000 Hz 覆盖人耳 20 kHz 上限。</li>\n<li>AudioBuffer 是「每声道一个 Float32Array」的内存音频，可直接读写采样；分清「帧」（含全部声道）与「采样」。</li>\n<li>音频线程以 128 帧的「渲染量子」为心跳整图同步推进——这定下了延迟下限（48k 下 ~2.67ms）、按块处理的约束和极紧的性能预算。</li>\n<li>熟练换算秒、帧、赫兹（FFT 桶宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>）是写调度与分析代码的基本功。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>这串数字从哪进图、怎么播：<a href=\"../nodes/source-nodes\">源节点</a></li>\n<li>渲染量子如何约束自定义处理：<a href=\"../synthesis/audio-worklet\">Audio Worklet 自定义处理</a></li>\n<li>脉冲响应 AudioBuffer 的妙用：<a href=\"../synthesis/effects-convolution\">效果与卷积混响</a></li>\n<li>延迟下限的工程后果：<a href=\"../practice/audio-performance\">音频性能与延迟</a></li>\n<li>跨库：类型化数组与 Transferable 在线程间零拷贝传 buffer，见 <a href=\"../../frontend-web-workers-offloading/communication/transferable-objects\">Web Workers · Transferable 对象</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采样与缓冲","id":"采样与缓冲"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AudioBuffer：声音在内存里的样子","id":"audiobuffer-声音在内存里的样子"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染量子：128 帧的心跳","id":"渲染量子-128-帧的心跳"},{"level":2,"text":"时间、频率与采样的换算","id":"时间-频率与采样的换算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"音频图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/foundations/audio-graph-model"},"next":{"title":"源节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/nodes/source-nodes"}}